            "en": { "answer": "The official website of the Faculty of Natural and Life Sciences, and Earth and Universe Sciences is available here: <br><br><svg class='fa-i' viewBox='0 0 512 512' aria-hidden='true'><path d='M351.9 280H161c2.9 64.5 17.2 123.9 37.5 167.4 11.4 24.5 23.7 41.8 35.1 52.4 11.2 10.5 18.9 12.2 22.9 12.2s11.7-1.7 22.9-12.2c11.4-10.6 23.7-28 35.1-52.4 20.3-43.5 34.6-102.9 37.5-167.4zm-191-48h190.9c-2.8-64.5-17.1-123.9-37.4-167.4-11.4-24.4-23.7-41.8-35.1-52.4C268.1 1.7 260.4 0 256.4 0s-11.7 1.7-22.9 12.2c-11.4 10.6-23.7 28-35.1 52.4-20.3 43.5-34.6 102.9-37.5 167.4m-48 0c3.5-85.6 25.6-165.1 57.9-217.3C78.7 47.3 10.9 131.2 1.5 232zM1.5 280c9.4 100.8 77.2 184.7 169.3 217.3-32.3-52.2-54.4-131.7-57.9-217.3zm398.4 0c-3.5 85.6-25.6 165.1-57.9 217.3 92.1-32.7 159.9-116.5 169.3-217.3zm111.4-48C501.9 131.2 434.1 47.3 342 14.7c32.3 52.2 54.4 131.7 57.9 217.3z'/></svg> <a href='https://fsnvstu.univ-guelma.dz/' target='_blank' style='color: #0b7a70; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;'>Faculty Website</a>" }
